  "worked_solution": "We distribute the absolute value over the multiplication, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|14y| & = \\\\ |14\\cdot y| & = \\\\ |14|\\cdot |y| & = \\\\ 14\\cdot |y| & = \\\\ 14|y|\\end{aligned}\n$$",
